==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Pretty Cat]] spawns.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Pretty Cat]] spawns.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
**1 [[Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Pretty Cat]] spawns.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Pretty Cat]] spawns.

==Strategy==
All enemies are at low magnification making them easy to deal with. Units such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] can help deal with the St. Pigge the 2nd and Sir Seal.

